<title>FINLAND: ALCOM PROPOSES TO DISSOLVE ITSELF.</title>
<headline>ALCOM PROPOSES TO DISSOLVE ITSELF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data systems group Alcom said in a statement on Friday it proposed to an extraordinary shareholders meeting that it be dissolved.</p>
<p>The meeting would be held on June 13 at 0900 local time.</p>
<p>&quot;The meeting will deal with the state of the company and the board's proposal to dissolve it by means of debt-restructuring,&quot; Alcom said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
